From: mscharged-port original-source fidelity
Subject: Retire standalone Specular preview decisions from original game modules
Upstream-base: a8187061af65aa2022bfd8dc2e32163089ea0090

Original game modules use the actual source view, skinnedVertices condition,
display lists and cached matrix wrapper. Bind the source-selected arrays with
real owned native extent/endian, retaining every attribute/address/stride.
Earlier software-skin/direct-draw substitutions remain isolated to transitional
standalone asset diagnostics. Native parameter layout adaptations are retained.
No lighting, render ordering, skin, alpha or source visibility redesign.

